  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280480,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Claude Codes up on their screens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282960,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like it's remarkably versatile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286160,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for different roles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287200,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you feel like nowadays,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288560,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the use cases\nthat are pushing the limit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One that I'm super excited\nabout is routines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294800,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is one engineer\non our team"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296640,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who launched voice mode across\nall of our products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299840,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, he has his routine set up\nthat just listens for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303920,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every ticket that comes,\nevery GitHub issue, every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307120,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bug report about voice mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308800,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And his Claude just picks it up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310640,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "proactively puts up a fix,\nand then pings the PR to him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314560,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when he got that working"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315840,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for voice, he thought, okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317280,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're getting a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318080,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of other feedback"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that isn't being responded to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321280,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, he also set up a routine\nto listen for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324240,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I ship this, small feature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326640,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there was like an edge\ncase in it that I didn't see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329280,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so someone filed\na bug for it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331360,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was going to\nget to the bug that night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334640,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my Claude was working,\nit said, wait a second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337200,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another Claude\nhas already fixed this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339360,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like,\nhow is this possible?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340800,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I've never talked to him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341840,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about this feature before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343040,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I pinged him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343760,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was like,\nhow did you fix this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345360,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so quickly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346080,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he said,\nhe has another routine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347600,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that just looks\nfor bug reports"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349200,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that haven't been responded\nto in five hours"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351440,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and puts up a fix,\nand he merges the ones that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353840,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are easy to verify."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355840,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Claude tells me this\nlike all the time now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357760,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That someone else\nhas already fixed it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359280,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's always like\nanother person’s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360400,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Claude that's working on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361840,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, yeah, that's\nbeen one of the changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364400,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like we're,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366160,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a while ago\nwe were trying to figure out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367440,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, how to use routines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368400,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I feel like\njust like the agent SDK"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370240,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was this first idea\nthat we could use Claude Code"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374320,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "programmatically. But"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375680,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like at the beginning,\nit just wasn't obvious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378160,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do we use it?\nWhat do we use it for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380320,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think routines are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381920,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first\nreally obvious application."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384400,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I don't know, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386320,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just does like all the code\nreview,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388240,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it babysits like every PR,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you remember back in the day\nyou used to actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have to like respond to code\nreview comments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394880,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You used to have to like\nfix CI. You used to have to rebase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398560,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Like I haven't done that\nin a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400960,
    "dDurationMs": 400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401360,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're in the CLI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're synchronously\nworking with Claude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405120,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what are your go to features?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407280,
    "dDurationMs": 320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407600,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What they used to\nbe is plan mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409840,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't use that anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411360,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you use instead?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412400,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Auto mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413200,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Auto mode?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413840,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414480,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of plan mode?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415600,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of plan mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416480,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah because the newer models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418240,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't actually need\nlike a planning step anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421120,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this was really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422160,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "important for like Opus 4\nthrough maybe 4.5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425520,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I think starting with\nfour six and definitely with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "four seven, it just doesn't\nneed that planning step."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429520,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think some people\nstill use it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430720,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They like to have that artifact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431840,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't use it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433120,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I just do\nauto mode for everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434720,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because then I start my Claude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436640,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it starts to work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I just like move on\nto the next Claude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439520,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I don't have to sit there\nand watch it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441120,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But from the very early\nstage we had this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442800,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like permission prompts model\nfor Claude Code, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445840,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like it runs a tool\nand then it asks you like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447520,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hey, are you okay\nrunning this tool?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449520,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you had to say yes or no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451680,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was kind of the best\nwe had a year and a half ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454880,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we didn't have,\nyou know, classifiers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The model was not as well\naligned as it is today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458880,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So auto mode was just such a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460320,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was such a big step up\nbecause actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462560,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't want to read\nmost of these requests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464560,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just routing it\nto a different model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466080,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and having it check for\nsecurity works so much better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468720,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469280,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if a thing like\nis a little suss or,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471760,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know,\nthis isn't the command that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473680,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you think you want to run\nor it's not safe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476400,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the model will just deny it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you can go back\nand you can allow it later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480160,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this has been\none of those, like, step changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482480,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We just, there's no way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483440,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we could have done this a year\nand a half ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484960,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just human nature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485920,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you accept\n99% of requests, that your eyes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489760,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just glaze over\nwhen you read it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491520,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so actually, we feel\nthat auto mode is more safe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494640,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than reading"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495280,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single\npermission prompt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496800,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it means"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497520,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that your only paying attention\nto the most important thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500640,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not like being spammed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502320,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bunch of things\nthat are just 99% yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504720,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think security\nis one of these things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506240,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like you can talk about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507280,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508080,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a totally different thing\nto actually do it correctly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510560,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it just doesn't\nalways look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512160,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way that you think\nit's going to look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513440,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's just all about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514480,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like always red teaming,\nalways pentesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517600,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "always looking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518480,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know,\nalways having a threat model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519760,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then using that\nto figure out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, how is this thing\ngoing to get attacked?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How are people going to get\nprompt injected?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525440,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I just feel like\nlike the team"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527200,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just like obsessed\nwith this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528800,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's so important\nbecause as a result,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532000,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just trust the agent to run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533840,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I can move on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535280,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I can just have\nlike a second agent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537520,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I didn't trust it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538720,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I just wouldn't\nhave been able to do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540960,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And internally,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542400,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to actually get auto\nmode out to our users,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545200,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we needed to really\ntrust it first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547520,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so what we did\nwas we collected thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550480,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of transcripts\nof like an entire agent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554000,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trajectory\nand a permission prompt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555920,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and had auto mode classify\nwhether or not it was safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558960,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was extremely good\nat this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560480,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then we got red teamers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561920,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we asked them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562880,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to try to prompt inject,\nand try to hack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565920,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the code base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567120,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we use this\nto create evals"
