  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573200,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "try to prompt inject and\nhack Claude Code’s auto mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577440,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we improved auto mode"
