  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614400,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we just have\nto relearn it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616560,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And auto mode was\ndefinitely one of these."
