  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795920,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fun doing engineering\nbecause the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797680,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the tedious part\nI don't have to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799200,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I'm\njust coming up with ideas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800480,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm talking to customers\nand every idea, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804400,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have a\nto do list anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805680,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like Claude\njust builds everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807520,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so my job is to come up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808640,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with these ideas\nand it's just so fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810560,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so here's a question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811600,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the future product or engineering?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813600,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, is everyone going to be a PM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814720,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or is everyone going to be\nan engineer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone's going to be both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818400,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel pretty strongly\nthat these roles are merging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821600,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like when we look at our team,\nour product team"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824720,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all writes code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825840,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our Devrel team all writes code.\nOur design team all writes code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830000,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we look at our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830960,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineers and a lot of them\nship products end to end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have an idea for what\nto build."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836640,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They build it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837920,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They work with legal\nand marketing to figure out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840400,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how we communicate this\nto the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841920,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make sure it's safe\nand with security, too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a lot of times\nthey just see through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846160,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this whole process end to end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848000,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think right now\nAI really benefits people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851280,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people who have a lot of curiosity,\nhave a lot of product tastes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854720,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who love to have this\nlike end to end ownership."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858240,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now a lot of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859680,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are running\nlike hundreds of agents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862000,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are the products\nthat you think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863680,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people should be adopting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864800,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as they transition from single\nto multiple to hundreds?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869120,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until recently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870240,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way that I wrote code was\nI had like six terminal tabs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874160,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with six git checkout\non the same repo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876480,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I would just like tab\nbetween them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879040,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now it's pretty different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880080,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have like one tab,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881360,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I use the new agent view\nthat we just shipped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883360,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884640,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm so glad\nthat we took a while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886160,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to iterate on it\nto make that really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888560,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also use the desktop app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890880,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I don't have to fiddle\nwith checkouts that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893280,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just like, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894160,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it does the work tree cloning\nor the like, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896640,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creates the work trees for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898640,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the thing\nthat I would not have expected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900720,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "six months ago is probably\nhalf my engineering now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903920,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do on my phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905600,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I just have like\nI have so many agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907840,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "running that\nI just start for my phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909440,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I use a remote control,\nwhich is like amazing now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912240,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like I will start\nsomething on my computer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914080,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I’ll just remote\ncontrol in from my phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916160,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I’ll just like, walk around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917280,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’ll get coffee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918160,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I'll check in\non my agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and maybe\nI'll start another agent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921840,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And sometimes I'm like,\ntalking to someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923520,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we come up\nwith a new idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925200,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’ll just start an agent on the spot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926720,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like talk to it\nwith voice mode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928480,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and just have it build\nsomething,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930000,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I don't even have to go\nback to my computer anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932240,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember\nwhen you started doing this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933920,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you would actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935600,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leave work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936320,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have your computer\non your desk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937920,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "open, plugged\nin, screen locked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940320,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I just thought you would,\nlike, come back to the office"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942400,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at some point\nto get your computer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944000,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then it would be like\npretty late and I was like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946560,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe he just left it here by accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948800,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it happened again\nthe next day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950480,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it happened again\nthe next day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952000,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952800,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wait, it's so weird\nbecause you're landing PRs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954960,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but your computer is right\nnext to me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957200,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I remember you responding\nand you're like, yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959760,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm coding from my couch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961280,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962240,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was the week the remote\ncontrol got really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964400,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964960,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So another thing that users"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966560,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are asking\nabout all the time is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how do you do\ncontext engineering,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970160,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially\nin a large enterprise?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972080,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972560,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, people used to talk\nabout prompt engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974320,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They used to like work\ncontext engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976480,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is sort of matching where\nthe model was at the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980880,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in the days\nof Sonnet 3.5,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982480,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you had to prompt engineer\nback in the days of Opus 4,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985200,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you had to context engineer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986720,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with the models of today,\nyou don't do any of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989520,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You give it the minimal\npossible system prompt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992160,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the minimal possible tools,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994000,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you let the model\nfigure it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996240,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like you just have to give"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997040,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the model some way\nto pull in the context."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998560,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's\nthe most important thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000400,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do you think about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001440,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see things very similarly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002720,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm a context minimalist,\nso my general philosophy is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006880,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tell the model\nonly what it needs to know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010080,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and let it figure out\nthe rest of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013120,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think\nwhen you give the model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014400,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "too much context, it's\nkind of like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016240,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're micromanaging it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018080,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And sometimes the model knows\na better way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020640,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get to the same outcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022480,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I personally prefer\nto give the model that freedom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025600,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027280,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then in general, we're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028400,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also making our harness\nmore lean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030240,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you have more room\nfor your own prompts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033280,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that follows\nyour prompts better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034960,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's all these\ndifferent ways to Claude now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037280,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I feel like in a year it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to be\na totally new set of things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's\ngoing to be so surprising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042880,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it's still these\nsame things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044400,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I think, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're seeing\nthese giant trends happening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047520,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now,\nagents are running for longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049360,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're more autonomous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051040,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very rarely am I running one\nagent at a time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053760,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's usually like a few agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055360,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or dozens\nor hundreds or thousands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so like the form factor\nfor that, it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059520,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to be really different\nthan what came before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061520,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I don't know\nwhat it's going to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062800,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think\nin a large part, it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064480,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to be up to the team\nto figure it out."
    } ]
